![Kalman gain $K_t$ of the local level model for the Nile data (pink), converging to its steady state $K_\infty$ (purple dashed). The grey dotted line is the smoothing parameter estimated by `ses()`.](portfolio_files/figure-pdf/fig-kalman-gain-1.pdf){#fig-kalman-gain}
