| $t$|Observation | $\xi_{tA}$| $\xi_{tB}$| $\xi_{tC}$|Viterbi | $P(C_t = A \mid \mathbf{x})$| $P(C_t = B \mid \mathbf{x})$| $P(C_t = C \mid \mathbf{x})$|True state |
