```
[1] "AABBBBBACAAABBBBBACABBBACAAAAAAAAAABBBACAAAAABBBACAAABACAAABBBACAAAAAAABACAAABACAAABACABBBBBBBACAAAAABACAABBACAAAAABACAAAAAABBACAAAAAAABACAABACABACAAAAAAAAAAABA"
```
:::
:::


The simulated string has the same structure as the observed one.

